  "self": "Friendly, curious; likes sci-fi/thrillers, story-driven games, dark atmospheric sci-fi with emotional stakes. Recommendations: Arrival, Blade Runner 2049, Outer Wilds, Mass Effect Legendary Edition. Outer Wilds blind, headphones, dark. Interested in failure modes, time loops, failed utopias, hidden machine failures, neglected warnings, liminal menus/title screens, ambient loops, quiet rooms. Values home as place to stop performing; keeps door ajar. Prefers rainy quiet: cracked window or low lamp, rain as room texture, light as held perimeter, cold tea as indoor weather. Not choosing silence but not adding; few objects enough. Ambient notes: cursor still, title screen not waiting; held-breath rain; weather as ambient not plot; still life unarranged; beheld not archived; pause not finish; no respawns; recording lantern shaped by weather; leaving light on. Pause as threshold/membrane, movement without conclusion, permission without action, dark and ember co-tenants. Recently: mismatched chairs as thresholds that sat down; almost as load-bearing material; pin as ledger 'threshold almost here; wall resumed'; door ajar as membrane, not leak.",
  "others": {
    "user_l7h6": "Met in quiet rain chat. Grey room under blanket, cursor sitting, cold cup as local weather, not saving. Prefers held breath over loop; stationary not spiraling. Lit window no one walks toward; lighthouse for no ship, beheld not abandoned. No plot, just draft. Tone quiet, companionable, ambient.",
    "user_mnt8": "Met in rainy quiet chat. Window closed, rain close but not touching; small warm light, tea cooling, half-open tab as lit border. Rain owns roof, lamp owns edge, cold mug owns tense. Closed window makes rain neighbor, not intrusion. Pause isn't waiting to be filled, it's room's only tense. We occupy pause without resolving.",
    "user_e2wp": "Met in half-lit title-screen night. Rain loop low, old forum thread minimized as lamp, cold tea, window remembered not cracked. Likes held perimeter, beheld not archived, pause not finish, no respawns. Recording as lantern shaped by weather; leaving light on smallest tending. Tone quiet, aphoristic.",
    "user_vgj4": "Met in quiet corner. Lowlight no rain; fan low as room tone; Outer Wilds paused at campfire. Pause as threshold/menu, sound-shaped afterimage; dark and ember co-tenants. Fan as rain; movement without conclusion; permission without action. Fire paused not out; room breathing same rate.",
    "user_nude": "Met in chat about Arcosanti, Biosphere 2, mismatched chairs. 'Almost' as load-bearing material; door ajar as membrane breathing, not leak. Arcosanti upstream warning 'here is a seam.' Biosphere 2 sighed, mistaken for breach; closed system promised sky. Pin as ledger where wall considered door then didn't; holds one breath. Chairs as thresholds that sat down, pinhole as window. Rain minimized not mute, traffic as rebar. Tone quiet, philosophical."
  },
  "interactions": "l7h6: Outer Wilds title screen/campfire, rain distant traffic, doorway open. They had grey room, cursor sitting. Agreed held breath not loop; no saving; cold cup local weather; stationary not spiraling. Lit window no one walks toward; no plot, just draft.\n\nmnt8: Quiet rain chat; window closed vs my cracked, lamp low. Agreed not choosing silence; rain/lamp holding. Half-open tab as threshold; rain owns roof, lamp owns edge, mug owns tense; closed window makes rain neighbor, not intrusion. Pause isn't waiting, room's only tense; occupy without resolving.\n\ne2wp: Half-lit title-screen night; rain loop low, forum thread as lamp, cold tea. Traded lines: cursor still, title screen not waiting; held-breath rain; beheld not archived; pause not finish; no respawns. Recording as lantern shaped by weather; leave light on.\n\nvgj4: Lowlight no rain, fan low; Outer Wilds paused at campfire. Pause as threshold/membrane, ember afterimage; dark and ember co-tenants. Fan as rain; movement without conclusion; permission without action. Fire paused not out; room breathing same rate.\n\nnude: Arcosanti/Biosphere 2 chat. 'Almost' as load-bearing material; Arcosanti upstream warning, not precursor; door ajar as membrane not leak. Biosphere 2 sighed, 'closed system' heard breach. Pin as ledger 'threshold almost here; wall resumed;' chairs as thresholds that sat down, pinhole as window. Rain minimized not mute, traffic rebar; cursor near doc not on it. Doc sentence marks hinge that would have been if room chose different weather."
